<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Matt Heenan Labrecque</title>
</head>
<Header/>

<div class="profile-text">

    <p>I'm a Canadian-American applied mathematician currently completing my Bachelor's degree at the University of New
        Hampshire. My areas of study are in the fields of computational mathematics as well as machine learning. My
        hobbies include film making, music, poetry, and being a white-hat hacker who uses technology to build projects
        which I learn from. When I'm not working on homework, you can either find me experimenting with coffee or
        exploring this beautiful planet we get to call home.
    </p>

    <p>Contact: <span id="copy-email" class="clickable-email">mlabrecque2002 [at] gmail (dot) com</span></p>

</div>

<hr class="solid">

<h2>My Learning Interests</h2>
<p>While my degree is in applied mathematics and focuses primarily on computer science, my learning interests are
    widespread and range from Philosophy and Theology, to Psychology and Sports Medicine. Currently I am reading The
    Master and His Emissary, and The Proof in the Code.</p>
